Notebook[{Cell["ValidateRepresentation", "ObjectName"], 
  Cell["ValidateRepresentation[g, r] checks the representation r against the \
group or context g: the relators of a complete presentation, the character \
and its irreducible multiplicities, and the basis properties.", "Usage"], 
  Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], Cell["ValidateRepresentation[g, r] checks \
r against g: Homomorphism (every relator of a complete presentation on the \
recorded generators evaluates to the identity), Character and Multiplicities \
(character inner products), Irreducible (the matched irrep ID, or None) and \
BasisProperties (Unitary; TDiagonal for an assigned S,T).", "Notes"], 
  Cell["The presentation of a live group is certified once in GAP when it is \
not yet stored; a context uses a presentation-built construction or an \
accepted group of the same state in this kernel. A matrix assignment that \
fails the relators gives Homomorphism -> False, a proven invalid result, \
distinct from a Failure.", "Notes"], Cell["Arithmetic -> \"Exact\" (default) \
decides everything exactly; \"Numerical\" reports residuals with Status \
\"Numerical\".", "Notes"], Cell["ValidateRepresentation[g, id] validates the \
stored active variant of irrep id. When the check (Verification -> Automatic \
or \"Exact\": exact; \"Numerical\": on N[]) proves it the irrep at a level \
above its stored status, the same matrices are stored again at that level (a \
new variant with the same identity; the weak one stays stored) and made \
active (one GAP generation; an exactly verified cyclotomic variant is then a \
native GAP variant), and the report has \"WrittenBack\" -> True. The report's \
\"VerificationStatus\" is the level of the checks, bounded by the group's \
status.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["Options (shared configured settings can override these defaults):", 
   "Notes"], Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{{Cell[" ", "TableRowIcon"], 
       Cell[BoxData["GroupModel"], "TableText"], Cell["Automatic", 
        "TableText"], Cell["Automatic, \"Original\", \"Permutation\" or \
\"PC\" for new method calculations; PC requires a solvable group. Restoration \
and compatible cache hits do not convert models. Import uses it only when \
computing a new character-validation source.", "TableText"]}, 
      {Cell[" ", "TableRowIcon"], Cell[BoxData["StoreGAPState"], 
        "TableText"], Cell["True", "TableText"], Cell["True retains verified \
state across calls; False keeps only call-local temporary checkpoints. Cached \
mathematical values remain available.", "TableText"]}, 
      {Cell[" ", "TableRowIcon"], Cell[BoxData["AttemptTimeLimit"], 
        "TableText"], Cell["600", "TableText"], Cell["Positive seconds or \
Infinity, per attempt including verification and saving. Automatic method \
attempts each receive this limit.", "TableText"]}, 
      {Cell[" ", "TableRowIcon"], Cell[BoxData["CoreBudget"], "TableText"], 
       Cell["Automatic", "TableText"], Cell["Positive integer at most \
$ProcessorCount, or Automatic to use the available count. Sequential \
algorithms run as separate worker processes.", "TableText"]}, 
      {Cell[" ", "TableRowIcon"], Cell[BoxData["MemoryBudget"], "TableText"], 
       Cell["Automatic", "TableText"], Cell["Positive integer bytes, or \
Automatic using half system memory less current kernel usage. Admission \
estimates and sampled total worker RSS enforce the allocation.", 
        "TableText"]}, {Cell[" ", "TableRowIcon"], 
       Cell[BoxData["ProgressFunction"], "TableText"], 
       Cell["Automatic", "TableText"], Cell["Automatic shows a notebook \
monitor when a front end is available; None is silent; a Function or user \
symbol receives progress associations. Callbacks should return promptly; \
failures/cancellation clean owned workers.", "TableText"]}, 
      {Cell[" ", "TableRowIcon"], Cell[BoxData["FieldMethod"], "TableText"], 
       Cell["Automatic", "TableText"], Cell["Automatic, \"Cyclotomic\", \
\"PrimitiveElement\", \"Radical\", \"RootReduce\" or a duplicate-free list of \
these.", "TableText"]}, {Cell[" ", "TableRowIcon"], 
       Cell[BoxData["Arithmetic"], "TableText"], Cell["\"Exact\"", 
        "TableText"], Cell["\"Exact\" proves identities exactly and refuses \
numerical input; \"Numerical\" works at WorkingPrecision (default 50) and \
checks residuals against Tolerance (default 10^(-Floor[p/2])). Tolerance is \
accepted only with numerical arithmetic.", "TableText"]}, 
      {Cell[" ", "TableRowIcon"], Cell[BoxData["WorkingPrecision"], 
        "TableText"], Cell["50", "TableText"], 
       Cell["See the method choices in this page's details.", "TableText"]}, 
      {Cell[" ", "TableRowIcon"], Cell[BoxData["Tolerance"], "TableText"], 
       Cell["Automatic", "TableText"], 
       Cell["See the method choices in this page's details.", "TableText"]}, 
      {Cell[" ", "TableRowIcon"], Cell[BoxData["Verification"], "TableText"], 
       Cell["Automatic", "TableText"], Cell["Automatic, \"Exact\", \
\"Numerical\" or None (the Validate functions: Automatic, \"Exact\" or \
\"Numerical\"; the modular-form functions have no \"Exact\" route).", 
        "TableText"]}}, GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {{Left}}}, 
     GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {Scaled[0.02], Scaled[0.3], 
         Scaled[0.18], Scaled[0.5]}}]], "3ColumnTableMod"], 
  Cell["See Also", "SeeAlsoSection"], 
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["RepresentationCharacter", 
      BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", ButtonData -> {"RepresentationCharacter.nb", 
        None}], "  |  ", ButtonBox["DecomposeRepresentation", 
      BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", ButtonData -> {"DecomposeRepresentation.nb", 
        None}], "  |  ", ButtonBox["Rep", BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", 
      ButtonData -> {"Rep.nb", None}]}], "SeeAlso"], 
  Cell["Examples Initialization", "ExamplesInitializationSection"], 
  Cell["Open this notebook in its repository location. GAP must be installed; \
LINS is required for its bounded search page. Evaluate the setup before the \
examples.", "ExampleText"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"Get", "[", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Nest", "[", RowBox[{"DirectoryName", 
                  ",", RowBox[{"NotebookFileName", "[", "]"}], ",", "5"}], 
                "]"}], ",", "\"Kernel\"", ",", "\"init.m\""}], "}"}], "]"}], 
        "]"}], ";"}]], "ExampleInitialization"], 
  Cell["Basic Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"g", "=", RowBox[{"BuildGroup", 
                "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"GroupPresentation", "[", RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"s\"", ",", "\"t\""}], "}"}], 
                      ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"s^2\"", ",", "\"t^2\"", 
                          ",", "\"(s.t)^3\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{"ComputeRepresentations", "\[Rule]", "False"}], 
                  ",", RowBox[{"StoreGAPState", "\[Rule]", "False"}]}], 
                "]"}]}], ",", "v"}], "}"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{RowBox[{"v", "=", RowBox[{"ValidateRepresentation", "[", 
              RowBox[{"g", ",", InterpretationBox[TemplateBox[{"\"Rep[\"", 
                   TemplateBox[{", ", "\", \"", TagBox[RowBox[{"(", 
                        "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{{"0", "1"}, {"1", "0"}}, 
                         RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnSpacings -> 1, 
                         RowAlignments -> Baseline, ColumnAlignments -> 
                          Center], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}], Function[BoxForm`e$, 
                       MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]], TagBox[RowBox[{"(", 
                        "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{{"0", SuperscriptBox[
                          "\[ExponentialE]", FractionBox[RowBox[{"2", " ", 
                          "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "\[Pi]"}], "3"]]}, 
                          {SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", RowBox[{"-", 
                          FractionBox[RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[ImaginaryI]", " ", 
                          "\[Pi]"}], "3"]}]], "0"}}, RowSpacings -> 1, 
                         ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, 
                         ColumnAlignments -> Center], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}], 
                      Function[BoxForm`e$, MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]}, 
                    "RowWithSeparators"], "\"]\""}, "RowDefault"], 
                 Rep[{{{0, 1}, {1, 0}}, {{0, Root[#1^2 + #1 + 1 & , 2]}, 
                    {Root[#1^2 + #1 + 1 & , 1], 0}}}]]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"v", "[", "\"Homomorphism\"", "]"}], 
              ",", RowBox[{"Values", "[", RowBox[{"v", "[", 
                  "\"Multiplicities\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"StringQ", 
                "[", RowBox[{"v", "[", "\"Irreducible\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], 
            "}"}]}]}], "]"}]], "Input", CellTags -> "VerifiedExample"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"True", ",", RowBox[{"{", "1", "}"}], 
        ",", "True"}], "}"}]], "Output"], Cell["Possible Issues", 
   "ExampleSection"], Cell["Invalid input returns a structured Failure. Check \
FailureQ before using the result.", "ExampleText"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"g", "=", RowBox[{"BuildGroup", "[", 
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"GroupPresentation", "[", RowBox[
                   {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"s\"", ",", "\"t\""}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"s^2\"", ",", "\"t^2\"", ",", 
                        "\"(s.t)^3\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", RowBox[
                 {"ComputeRepresentations", "\[Rule]", "False"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"StoreGAPState", "\[Rule]", "False"}]}], "]"}]}], 
          "}"}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"ValidateRepresentation", "[", 
              RowBox[{"g", ",", InterpretationBox[TemplateBox[{"\"Rep[\"", 
                   TemplateBox[{", ", "\", \"", TagBox[RowBox[{"(", 
                        "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{{"1"}}, RowSpacings -> 1, 
                         ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, 
                         ColumnAlignments -> Center], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}], 
                      Function[BoxForm`e$, MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]], 
                     TagBox[RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[
                         {{RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, 
                         ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, 
                         ColumnAlignments -> Center], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}], 
                      Function[BoxForm`e$, MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]}, 
                    "RowWithSeparators"], "\"]\""}, "RowDefault"], 
                 Rep[{{{1}}, {{-1}}}]]}], "]"}], "[", "\"Irreducible\"", 
            "]"}], "===", "None"}]}], "]"}]], "Input", 
   CellTags -> "VerifiedErrorExample"], Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output"], 
  Cell["Related Guides", "MoreAboutSection"], 
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["Constructing finite groups", 
